# DianaSh golden corpus. Recorded from the C# shell, byte for byte, and frozen since its recorder went with the C# core host on 2026-11-07 - see EmuSen_DianaSh.md §13.4.
# Patterns: <ROOT> is the sandbox's real root, <TEMP> the corpus's real temporary folder, <INSTALL> the install's real directory;
# a 'match' block is a regular expression the whole output must match, written where a line prints a time or a measured number.
command tilemap
usage 1   tilemap <space> <addr> <cols> <rows>
usage 2                                 decode <cols>x<rows> tilemap entries starting at <addr>
usage 3                                 as a text grid, one already-formatted label per cell -
usage 4                                 see IDebugTarget.DecodeTilemapEntry for what a label
usage 5                                 means on the current core. Caller supplies the exact base
usage 6                                 address (see BG1SC/etc via `regs`) - this doesn't resolve
usage 7                                 BG-layer-to-tilemap-address mapping itself.

case with no target
target none
covers 1
$ tilemap VRAM 0 1 1
out 65
Error: No ROM loaded - this command needs an active debug target.
status 1
action none
end

